# Blighter Restrictor - login times check (since 1.4.0).
# Purpose: run "blighter-apply tick" (started every minute by
# blighter-login.timer, and by the parent app when it changes something):
# lock or unlock the child's account for the login times, show the 15 / 5
# minute warnings and carry out a warned log out / restart / shut down.
